WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.860
A statue was never decoration alone.

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:10.807
Set in a temple court or before a tomb, it gave offerings a place to land and memory a face to find.

00:00:10.807 --> 00:00:24.000
Festivals passed before it, priests poured water at its feet, and the royal name carved on its base carried its owner into a future the sculptor could only imagine.

